  "details": "An error message displaying during a VRChat Home outage displays the old Twitter branding. Twitter was rebranded to X in 2023.\n\nActual result: \"Check our [twitter](https://twitter.com/VRChat)?\" (https://twitter.com/VRChat)\n\nExpected result: \"Check our social media [@VRChat on X](https://x.com/VRChat)?\" (https://x.com/VRChat)\n\nAdditional info: The full error message is quoted below.\n\n----\n\nVRChat\n\nAn error has occurred. To continue:\n\nPress the F5 to refresh the website, or\n\nPress the back button to leave the website, or\n\nCheck our twitter?\n\nPress CTRL+ALT+DEL to restart your computer. If you do this, you will lose any unsaved information in all open applications.\n\n`500 Request failed with status code 500`",
